DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppaamm__vveerrrroorr() function passes its arguments to pam_vprompt(3) with a
     style argument of PAM_ERROR_MSG, and discards the response.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The ppaamm__vveerrrroorr() function returns one of the following values:

     [PAM_SUCCESS]       Success.

     [PAM_BUF_ERR]       Memory buffer error.

     [PAM_CONV_ERR]      Conversation failure.

     [PAM_SYSTEM_ERR]    System error.

